          "body": "Patch looks good!\n\nWe save a lot of space (~860 MB -> ~552 MB) putting the offsets in the postings instead of term vectors.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
